  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2025200,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202520000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202520000": {
          "id": 202520000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "在前往仙舟的路上，我把《狐狐隊大戰絨絨號》所有聯名店都去了一遍",
          "next": [
            202520001
          ]
        },
        "202520001": {
          "id": 202520001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "徽章、立牌、模型、防曬乳、行動電源、掃地機器人——全部！拿下！",
          "next": [
            202520002,
            202520003
          ]
        },
        "202520002": {
          "id": 202520002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我是絨絨號警察，緋緋狐你怎麼回事，不愛《絨絨號》了嗎？",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520003": {
          "id": 202520003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "《狐狐隊大戰絨絨號》？有版權嗎？",
          "next": [
            202520004
          ]
        },
        "202520004": {
          "id": 202520004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "有的有的！聽說是QR寇老師親自授權——「就靠各位二創大神為絨絨號續命啦！」",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520005": {
          "id": 202520005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "《絨絨號》休刊期間，就讓人家吃點代餐來填補空虛吧！",
          "next": [
            202520006
          ]
        },
        "202520006": {
          "id": 202520006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "不過「吃」得是有點撐……周邊買太多了，都不知道要放在哪裡了",
          "next": [
            202520007
          ]
        },
        "202520007": {
          "id": 202520007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "正當我毫無頭緒的時候……",
          "next": [
            202520008
          ]
        },
        "202520008": {
          "id": 202520008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "「狐狐隊」隊長水冰狐指引了我！",
          "next": [
            202520009
          ]
        },
        "202520009": {
          "id": 202520009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "第二卷中，水冰狐使用了「深井冰冰大冰箱」——讓狐狐們藏進冰箱，順著食物鏈成功潛入絨絨號！",
          "next": [
            202520010
          ]
        },
        "202520010": {
          "id": 202520010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "深不可測……冰箱居然可以儲存食物之外的東西",
          "next": [
            202520011
          ]
        },
        "202520011": {
          "id": 202520011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "於是我立刻下單了十台狐狐隊、十台絨絨號聯名冰箱",
          "next": [
            202520012
          ]
        },
        "202520012": {
          "id": 202520012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "給我沒地方放的漫畫和周邊們，一個冰涼的家",
          "next": [
            202520013,
            202520014
          ]
        },
        "202520013": {
          "id": 202520013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "小心消費主義的陷阱",
          "next": [
            202520015
          ]
        },
        "202520014": {
          "id": 202520014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "有那麼多東西要裝嗎？小心消費主義的陷阱啊",
          "next": [
            202520017
          ]
        },
        "202520015": {
          "id": 202520015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好冷漠無情的大人發言，小浣熊，你變了",
          "next": [
            202520016
          ]
        },
        "202520016": {
          "id": 202520016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "我可不是衝動消費",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520017": {
          "id": 202520017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "有的有的，我可不是衝動消費",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520018": {
          "id": 202520018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台裝首刷版漫畫們，一台裝典藏版……",
          "next": [
            202520019
          ]
        },
        "202520019": {
          "id": 202520019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台裝必入手周邊們，一台裝聯名限定……",
          "next": [
            202520020
          ]
        },
        "202520020": {
          "id": 202520020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "一台裝電子寵物蛋們，一台裝……裝……",
          "next": [
            202520021,
            202520022,
            202520023
          ]
        },
        "202520021": {
          "id": 202520021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "別算了，買多了沒地方用就送我吧",
          "next": [
            202520024
          ]
        },
        "202520022": {
          "id": 202520022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "就從沒想過裝吃的是嗎？讓冰箱回歸初心吧！",
          "next": [
            202520025
          ]
        },
        "202520023": {
          "id": 202520023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "隔壁神探事務所老狼一定羨慕死了",
          "next": [
            202520026
          ]
        },
        "202520024": {
          "id": 202520024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！其實水冰狐的「深井冰冰大冰箱」最後也是被絨絨號拿下的",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520025": {
          "id": 202520025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！一台裝吃的！",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520026": {
          "id": 202520026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "好主意！一台送不死狼偵探！",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520027": {
          "id": 202520027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "剩下的就全部送給星穹列車！就這樣決定了",
          "next": [
            202520028
          ]
        },
        "202520028": {
          "id": 202520028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "你看，都找到用處了吧～",
          "next": [
            202520029
          ]
        },
        "202520029": {
          "id": 202520029,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "next": [
            202520030
          ]
        },
        "202520030": {
          "id": 202520030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "已填好郵寄單，小浣熊記得查收哦！",
          "next": [
            202520031
          ]
        },
        "202520031": {
          "id": 202520031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "大事解決，我繼續逛啦！絨絨號現在聯名超多的……",
          "next": []
        }
      },
